---
import { Icon } from "astro-icon/components";
import ButtonPrimary from "./ButtonPrimary.astro";
import ButtonShine from "./ButtonShine.astro";
---

<section
    id="inicio"
    class="mask-gradient hero -mt-22 lg:mt-0 h-screen lg:min-h-[800] relative isolate w-full overflow-hidden"
>
    <div
        class="relative mx-auto flex h-full w-full max-w-7xl flex-col justify-center overflow-hidden lg:flex-row lg:items-center lg:justify-between lg:gap-10"
    >
        <video
            class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 z-0 h-full w-full object-cover lg:hidden"
            autoplay
            muted
            loop
            playsinline
            preload="metadata"
            aria-hidden="true"
        >
            <source
                src="https://marialerealtor-com-255189.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/video_2026-10-10_11-54-48.mp4"
                type="video/mp4"
            />
        </video>
        <div
            class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 z-0 bg-black/50 lg:hidden"
            aria-hidden="true"
        >
        </div>
        <div
            class="hero-content relative z-10 mx-auto flex w-full flex-1 items-end px-6 py-4 lg:gap-16 lg:items-center"
        >
            <div class="hero-copy flex max-w-2xl flex-col items-start pb-16">
                <div class="subtitle-border rounded-2xl">
                    <h2
                        id="subtitile-animate"
                        class="w-max whitespace-nowrap rounded-full bg-[#0d0f13] px-2 py-1 text-[.8em] lg:text-2xl font-extralight"
                    >
                        Fotografo Profecional
                    </h2>
                </div>
                <h1
                    class="max-w-xl font-serif text-5xl font-normal leading-[1.02] text-white sm:text-6xl lg:text-7xl xl:text-8xl"
                >
                    Moisés Magariño
                </h1>
                <br />
                <p
                    class="mb-9 w-full text-base leading-7 text-gray-300 sm:text-lg"
                >
                    Como fotógrafo, entiendo que un hogar no es solo una
                    estructura, sino el escenario donde comienzan nuevas
                    historias. A través de mi lente y la luz única de Miami,
                    transformo propiedades en lugares deseados e instantes
                    cotidianos en imágenes con
                    <!-- alma. 📸 Fotografía Inmobiliaria & Estilo de Vida | Miami &
                    South Florida 📩 Contemos tu historia hoy. -->
                </p>
                <div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-3 sm:w-fit sm:flex-row">
                    <ButtonPrimary
                        title="Ver Portafolio"
                        link="#portafolio"
                        additionalClass="invert-colors w-full items-center justify-center border border-[#d9dde0] px-5 py-3 text-sm font-medium text-[#202427] transition-colors sm:w-fit"
                        bg="#d9dde0"
                    >
                        <Icon name="camera-icon" size={20} />
                    </ButtonPrimary>

                    <ButtonShine
                        href="https://wa.link/c24rca"
                        class="w-full flex items-center justify-center border border-[#d9dde0]/70 px-5 py-3 text-sm font-medium text-[#e3e6e8] sm:w-fit"
                        text="Contactar"
                    >
                        <Icon name="whatsapp-solid" size={19} />
                    </ButtonShine>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div
                class="hero-video relative hidden max-h-170 w-full max-w-95 self-center lg:flex lg:w-[360px] lg:flex-none lg:aspect-9/12 xl:aspect-9/14"
            >
                <video
                    class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover rounded-2xl"
                    autoplay
                    muted
                    loop
                    playsinline
                    preload="metadata"
                    aria-hidden="true"
                >
                    <source
                        src="https://marialerealtor-com-255189.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/video_2026-10-10_11-54-48.mp4"
                        type="video/mp4"
                    />
                </video>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <style is:global>
        .mask-gradien {
            -webkit-mask-image: linear-gradient(
                to bottom,
                #000 0%,
                #000 90%,
                transparent 100%
            );
            mask-image: linear-gradient(
                to bottom,
                #000 0%,
                #000 90%,
                transparent 100%
            );
        }
    </style>

    <style>
        .subtitle-border {
            position: relative;
            isolation: isolate;
            display: inline-flex;
            width: max-content;
            max-width: 100%;
            overflow: hidden;
            border-radius: 9999px;
            padding: 1px;
        }

        .subtitle-border::before {
            position: absolute;
            z-index: -1;
            inset: -100%;
            background: conic-gradient(
                transparent 0deg 322deg,
                rgba(217, 221, 224, 0.55) 334deg,
                #fff 340deg,
                transparent 356deg 360deg
            );
            content: "";
            animation: subtitle-border-orbit 3s linear infinite;
        }

        @keyframes subtitle-border-orbit {
            to {
                transform: rotate(1turn);
            }
        }

        @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
            .subtitle-border::before {
                animation: none;
            }
        }

        .hero {
            background:
                radial-gradient(
                    ellipse at 78% 48%,
                    rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.095),
                    transparent 52%
                ),
                var(--color-bg);
        }
    </style>
</section>
